Hi <%= @contact.first_name %>,

You have received an invoice from <%= @location&.name || @company.name %>.<%= ' Please click the link below to view your invoice or make a payment.' if @payments_enabled %><%= ' Please click the link below to view your invoice.' unless @payments_enabled %>

INVOICE DETAILS
================
Invoice Number: <%= @invoice.invoice_number %>
Invoice Date:   <%= @invoice.invoice_date.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %>
